{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122477","id":4290991449,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_w1VZ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122477.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122477/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122477/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122477/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f370359286f48878edd525731284d8e56ea77e7","number":122477,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix `SpotLight3D`/`OmniLight3D` `light_projector` doesn't render when `shadow_enabled` is `false`","user":{"login":"DaveTheEggman","id":316468666,"node_id":"U_kgDOEtztug","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/316468666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveTheEggman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveTheEggman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #121615 \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### The Problem\r\nWhen `shadow_enabled` is set to `false` on a SpotLight3D/OmniLight3D, `LightStorage::update_light_buffers` previously skipped calculating `light_data.shadow_matrix` altogether. However, the spotlight shader relies on `shadow_matrix` to calculate projector UVs whenever a `light_projector` texture is assigned but since `shadow_matrix` was never written when shadows were disabled, the shader read garbage/uninitialized matrix data, resulting in broken projector UVs, black output or visual glitches from stale memory.\r\n\r\n### The Solution\r\nThis PR adds a fallback check inside `LightStorage::update_light_buffers` for when shadows are disabled (`has_shadow` is `false`). If a spotlight has a valid projector texture assigned (`has_projector` is `true`), the matrix is now calculated manually using the spotlight's parameters (`spot_angle`, `radius`, `light_transform`) & stored into `light_data.shadow_matrix`.\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">Before (SpotLight3D)</th>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">After (SpotLight3D)</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f4bbc07-674f-46be-9d54-698ea4310c3f\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Before View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fe196fe-aab8-4721-b2b9-7d6f8cbcf3f8\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"After View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">Before (OmniLight3D)</th>\r\n    <th align=\"center\">After (OmniLight3D)</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e3e5dbc-6764-4fb7-b2d7-dcbc157f50fc\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Before View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td>\r\n      <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56662dcc-96d6-474d-8049-2d68f739f685\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"After View\" />\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n### MRP (with both):\r\n[121615.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30376960/121615.zip)\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure:\r\nThis PR doesn't use AI, it's all human written code & same goes for the desc 🙃","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscr